{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart:offset-26996", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/log_workout.dart", "location": "offset-26996", "text": "'Strain and calories come from the 1-second heart rate '\n'inside these times, through the same method the day '\n'uses. Nothing is estimated from the duration.'", "sha256": "0d10f78926f43bb18de4f20c54cd5106f92a4c4d6adf6ca01580b38d4d82242c", "kind": "dart", "start": 26996, "end": 27211, "line": 687}
