{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-3353", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-3353", "text": "'Resting heart rate'", "sha256": "8109f61a2ba69dd70f43fd8f6773ad54824d10b44e2393208cecbcb21003e97d", "kind": "dart", "start": 3353, "end": 3373, "line": 95}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-3476", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-3476", "text": "'The lowest sustained sleeping heart rate of the night, taken over '\n'a rolling window of the overnight series. Not a spot reading, and not '\n'a daytime minimum.'", "sha256": "fb1798df9e2d864a3933fcf2be5c02510609bbaa1bd850ba6e6cb94eb2239851", "kind": "dart", "start": 3476, "end": 3654, "line": 100}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-3670", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-3670", "text": "'Nocturnal heart-rate minimum; personal baseline, not population'", "sha256": "f8cdf5d2ca9afada3a89dba817bbc3a32b64f603bdb98d10b7376b94a1938772", "kind": "dart", "start": 3670, "end": 3735, "line": 103}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-3917", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-3917", "text": "'RMSSD over the longest artefact-free window during sleep. Beat '\n'timing is recovered from the band\\'s 1 Hz records and corrected by '\n'the Lipponen–Tarvainen method before any statistic is taken. '\n'Pulse-derived, so this is PRV: real and trendable, but not ECG HRV.'", "sha256": "af316c3bb91bcf77c226f686780d4e020ca1eadcf35af00636d91dd629252cdc", "kind": "dart", "start": 3917, "end": 4210, "line": 112}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-4226", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-4226", "text": "'Task Force 1996 · Lipponen & Tarvainen 2019'", "sha256": "ae69f1d6bead98900e53ec8492ed172f8038012bd1489402763acb8c182bc9fb", "kind": "dart", "start": 4226, "end": 4271, "line": 116}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-4699", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-4699", "text": "'A weighted composite of a handful of inputs, each scored against '\n'your own history. Every input\\'s weight, and whether last night had '\n'enough history to use it, is listed on the Readiness screen. Missing '\n'inputs are re-weighted, never zero-filled.'", "sha256": "03060d6ea988ac1b23a8daae72eacb36f9091e1444723ffa3dfb3916338a9f78", "kind": "dart", "start": 4699, "end": 4978, "line": 127}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-4994", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-4994", "text": "'Plews 2013 (lnRMSSD) · Hopkins smallest-worthwhile-change gate'", "sha256": "f4cd44cefdd28e22a597787edbeab0d50d812a6e4ff9497bcc12b06ff2698c6e", "kind": "dart", "start": 4994, "end": 5058, "line": 131}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-5268", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-5268", "text": "'Respiratory rate'", "sha256": "235e5b123148851a53aa98e1bab53f05fd7b7c971be53ca02655fc4dd67397ab", "kind": "dart", "start": 5268, "end": 5286, "line": 141}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-5392", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-5392", "text": "'Breathing rate recovered from respiratory sinus arrhythmia — the '\n'periodic modulation breathing imposes on beat timing — over a grid of '\n'candidate rates.'", "sha256": "93302beb69989e31d6f03f20467361fe07709a092f0fd70a8465fc7fcab773da", "kind": "dart", "start": 5392, "end": 5567, "line": 146}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-5703", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-5703", "text": "'Time asleep'", "sha256": "2d4252830bd07e1d657054006c2803f05e467d228516596669b02b822437d77a", "kind": "dart", "start": 5703, "end": 5716, "line": 154}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-5794", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-5794", "text": "'Total sleep time from the wrist z-angle sleep window, staged by a '\n'combined actigraphy and heart-rate model.'", "sha256": "a7110440d659f741efc282305d939683ceda6b301811bcf7b371a0c9f60de587", "kind": "dart", "start": 5794, "end": 5914, "line": 158}
