{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-6110", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-6110", "text": "'Sleep efficiency'", "sha256": "4f65a2edcfdc5e81e5be10a5ea222bb03075ed685386049a45c954512fd0f6f1", "kind": "dart", "start": 6110, "end": 6128, "line": 165}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-6209", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-6209", "text": "'Time asleep as a fraction of time in bed.'", "sha256": "25264681ab8d3c4f365ab5396c40b0b5c412e1ffa4405c6f24cb83e7db9973d9", "kind": "dart", "start": 6209, "end": 6252, "line": 169}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-6268", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-6268", "text": "'AASM sleep-accounting definitions'", "sha256": "f030366378ba940224ad81f81f738f94b0bd814e8b7af6aaae2aa6903cf98d4d", "kind": "dart", "start": 6268, "end": 6303, "line": 170}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-6422", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-6422", "text": "'Deep sleep'", "sha256": "5d791f11d088ef5e7548d76d49d67051398e4591c1fe782fd1554d9b384b827f", "kind": "dart", "start": 6422, "end": 6434, "line": 175}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-6512", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-6512", "text": "'A low-confidence overlay: a wrist sensor cannot see slow-wave '\n'activity, so deep sleep here is heart-rate flatness inside NREM.'", "sha256": "34cc5918338b1973854a7b66591789f64901b5bd83d36a0d29d35f92333beed5", "kind": "dart", "start": 6512, "end": 6651, "line": 179}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-6667", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-6667", "text": "'Cole–Kripke wake spine + HRV overlay'", "sha256": "f60fc0c7486f50a02112b08aa044ae8a6e18a7fe565ff4f299bdb41773dc0876", "kind": "dart", "start": 6667, "end": 6705, "line": 181}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-6822", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-6822", "text": "'REM sleep'", "sha256": "d60648de8adce5148c08f8a1790983645522a70d0fb320ad60ca31b90603b5f3", "kind": "dart", "start": 6822, "end": 6833, "line": 186}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-6911", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-6911", "text": "'Staged from beat-timing variability and movement. A wrist sensor '\n'separates REM from light sleep only approximately.'", "sha256": "02079c272cb92dfb0855fc26bef981f76e0338b76097b865716f8dec801abc97", "kind": "dart", "start": 6911, "end": 7039, "line": 190}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-7055", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-7055", "text": "'Webster / Cole–Kripke rescoring + HRV staging'", "sha256": "efe32c4b031347668af85ef0ff7d2af8971a6bfc8578aec0d732a38d7c2ef59d", "kind": "dart", "start": 7055, "end": 7102, "line": 192}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-7317", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-7317", "text": "'Counted, never modelled. A step count comes from a gait-capable '\n'counter: the band\\'s 100 Hz pedometer while it streams, or your '\n'phone\\'s. Each stretch of the day is counted by whichever of the two '\n'was actually recording it, and a stretch both covered is counted '\n'once, so a session never takes the day from the sensor that carried '\n'the rest of it. There is no 1 Hz estimate — walking cadence sits above what '\n'one sample a second can resolve, so a day with no counter behind it '\n'reports no steps rather than a guess.'", "sha256": "617e99fe0db2192741599934599cfddd1fbb9da02087860251082929ff87468b", "kind": "dart", "start": 7317, "end": 7907, "line": 201}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-7923", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-7923", "text": "'AN-2554 pedometer · phone pedometer (HealthKit / Health Connect)'", "sha256": "8df8ad487741e8232e6aa12f1bdc3e256bac001ba89375eaffc0323894172aa7", "kind": "dart", "start": 7923, "end": 7989, "line": 209}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-8463", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-8463", "text": "'Active energy'", "sha256": "2e1bc17ccc2ef721cfd529c44d1404c74a9d8771fc007f73092101772a63852b", "kind": "dart", "start": 8463, "end": 8478, "line": 219}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-8560", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-8560", "text": "'Heart-rate-to-energy regression over the waking span, anchored on '\n'your weight, age and sex. An estimate, and sensitive to all three.'", "sha256": "42c284e11bc89e28799d8eb70c0175d8908b493e8c4de3699359df8510fb45a4", "kind": "dart", "start": 8560, "end": 8705, "line": 223}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-8721", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-8721", "text": "'Keytel 2005 · Harris–Benedict / Mifflin BMR floor'", "sha256": "57ca6ce0f0fa36f8d381c6693b8be1f0a1c540c1d9320fe154baa9733d5e312c", "kind": "dart", "start": 8721, "end": 8772, "line": 225}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-8943", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-8943", "text": "'Cardiovascular load over the day, compressed onto a 0–21 scale.'", "sha256": "8a0ef8f1d8758c639a3fd5d31e24d733974d5ccb4a513fffcd295fb00697ee51", "kind": "dart", "start": 8943, "end": 9008, "line": 233}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-9024", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-9024", "text": "'Banister TRIMP family · log-compressed'", "sha256": "23033283e5082302696d58af71d96ff50909a100c17468e57c925c343b5918a4", "kind": "dart", "start": 9024, "end": 9064, "line": 234}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-9163", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-9163", "text": "'Training load'", "sha256": "12c471527f0dd6650f51f66f922c0b28798371162af154c3e52be07f121b3ece", "kind": "dart", "start": 9163, "end": 9178, "line": 239}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-9245", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-9245", "text": "'Training impulse: time in each heart-rate zone, weighted by the '\n'physiological cost of that zone.'", "sha256": "a4ddcc97894543b21e4f9a7f0673a2210572983e4806c3f390e0fcd5089d5aa2", "kind": "dart", "start": 9245, "end": 9354, "line": 242}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-9598", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-9598", "text": "'Baevsky stress index over a resting window: a histogram measure of '\n'how tightly beat intervals cluster. There is deliberately no fallback '\n'when the resting window is missing.'", "sha256": "6cedfa0f4aeece102efd568ecc596881c18205d203c07b06e87d5b1241096451", "kind": "dart", "start": 9598, "end": 9794, "line": 253}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-9925", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-9925", "text": "'Nocturnal HR dip'", "sha256": "eedaa3486b2fe25417be9fa9ddb7fb7d5b9c3eb8d38bfbe8b9d0f0c08e279d0b", "kind": "dart", "start": 9925, "end": 9943, "line": 261}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-10029", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-10029", "text": "'How far sleeping heart rate falls below the waking average.'", "sha256": "11701e71baeb3f21c6ff87679dba5a7b0eedc03996cc3afdcb6dee3e7a5d08fc", "kind": "dart", "start": 10029, "end": 10090, "line": 265}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-10106", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-10106", "text": "'Nocturnal dipping literature; personal baseline'", "sha256": "e83cffc3767f02ebce83cf32ad7795008a87785aab075cbb5557b6ccbfaff008", "kind": "dart", "start": 10106, "end": 10155, "line": 266}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-10250", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-10250", "text": "'Heart-rate recovery'", "sha256": "30d74aa6bd9e14ccc88fca1549bee489e3585f2878f0bc049e9db1f8291f8744", "kind": "dart", "start": 10250, "end": 10271, "line": 271}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-10354", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-10354", "text": "'The drop in heart rate over the 60 seconds after a bout ends, '\n'averaged across the day\\'s bouts.'", "sha256": "c1de39c69c51df40c35fe8e11b93e3d617c483cbfefd2e144bb9cfca4b574e57", "kind": "dart", "start": 10354, "end": 10462, "line": 275}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-10678", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-10678", "text": "'The ratio of low- to high-frequency power in beat-interval '\n'variability, from a Lomb–Scargle periodogram (the series is unevenly '\n'sampled, so an FFT would be wrong).'", "sha256": "4bd256104200e9534a1c7ea710790fc8d00bab36beeb3287cee5ff034a9a42b8", "kind": "dart", "start": 10678, "end": 10865, "line": 285}
