{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-11437", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-11437", "text": "'Coefficient of variation of per-window respiratory rate across '\n'the night.'", "sha256": "22daed284e485dafb8332eeac81afa9e6402688d31f71e6237fc6409fed45651", "kind": "dart", "start": 11437, "end": 11523, "line": 308}
