{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-11988", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-11988", "text": "'Minutes of sleep detected OUTSIDE the main night: the same wrist '\n'z-angle window detector the night uses, confirmed by a heart-rate dip. '\n'Naps are counted separately and never folded into time asleep.'", "sha256": "8fc4b54409c0542ca56d04961e58f5d4b30bdda3408a44edaeca28640ed15f65", "kind": "dart", "start": 11988, "end": 12210, "line": 322}
