{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-12408", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-12408", "text": "'Movement minutes'", "sha256": "a3f732474700d5528a6d05af333c8d3a4044594e0e96fb018480af013e7a1a50", "kind": "dart", "start": 12408, "end": 12426, "line": 330}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-12509", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-12509", "text": "'Minutes whose acceleration sits above a movement floor. That floor '\n'is pooled from your own recent days once there are enough of them, and '\n'a population one before that. This is activity VOLUME, not locomotion: '\n'steps are counted by a pedometer and are never derived from it.'", "sha256": "3ea3ff81e5f2ce725de104be73a052af5572ae1114fd47008207f0562704bd35", "kind": "dart", "start": 12509, "end": 12816, "line": 334}
