{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-12974", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-12974", "text": "'Wear time'", "sha256": "74ef84252a269368d88a75ca15db9f0338c5c3acdebc69710899dfbc753a0777", "kind": "dart", "start": 12974, "end": 12985, "line": 343}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart:offset-13065", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/metric_detail.dart", "location": "offset-13065", "text": "'Minutes with a band record present. The band logs to flash only '\n'while it is on a wrist, so record presence IS wear.'", "sha256": "384a2121e445355e54495052e3a85303cab5cd1bced0bf91c34bf4b8d8a9bef4", "kind": "dart", "start": 13065, "end": 13193, "line": 347}
